  m_text: '<b>Rotation And Targetting</b>


    - Rotate the ship and fire on the
    target.

    - To rotate the ship, you can use the quick shortcut button in the
    movement panel (enable movement by changing move modes). Have a target selected,
    click on the quick rotate button.

    - Alternatively, rotate the ship manualy.

'
